    "intro_narrative": "You awaken in the dark, humming halls of the abandoned Orion Station. Red emergency lights bathe the corridor, and a mechanical voice repeats a lockdown warning. The oxygen scrubbers are failing, and the only way to override the bulkheads is to obtain the master encryption key. To do this, you must navigate through a series of forgotten terminals, intercept garbled data signals, and crack open the station's secure storage units before the air runs out. Your survival depends on piecing together the broken systems of the facility.",
